OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremaining windy with showers
OL,7,Fcontinuing into the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight, these perhaps quite
OL,9,Ffrequent for Orkney. Southwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds strengthening to gales at times
OL,11,Fand backing northwesterly so feeling
OL,12,Fquite cool later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FScattered showers and strong
OL,15,Fwinds in the morning, chance of gales
OL,16,Fat first. Winds gradually easing
OL,17,Fduring the day and showers finally
OL,18,Fbecoming less frequent with some
OL,19,Fafternoon brightness likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
