OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Ffor a time on Monday and feeling
OL,7,Fwarmer. Mostly dry start Tuesday but
OL,8,Fstill some showers at times, rain
OL,9,Fspreading east later. Cooler Wednesday
OL,10,Fwith bright spells, some showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
